#, python-format, safe-html
msgid ""
"There is %(count)s member of this group. Deleting the group might affect "
"their access."
msgid_plural ""
"There are %(count)s members of this group. Deleting the group might affect "
"their access."
msgstr[0] ""
"Det finns %(count)s medlem i gruppen. Om gruppen tas bort kan medlemmens "
"åtkomst påverkas."
msgstr[1] ""
